PARITY (web region → native), every branch reproduced
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
• Two panels, responsive: web `grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2` → compact VStack / regular HStack.
• Recent Drives (cyan Route): up to 5 rows. Value = convertDistanceFromSI(distance_m ?? 0, unitPrefs.distance)
  at 1dp + " {unit}" (web AnimatedNumber + leading-space suffix). Duration reads SECONDS
  "{floor(s/3600)}h {fmtInt(floor((s%3600)/60))}m". SoC `{start}% → {end}%` only when BOTH bounds present.
  "View all" → /drives. Empty → "No drives recorded yet".
• Recent Charges (emerald BatteryCharging/Zap): up to 5 rows. Value = convertEnergyFromSI(total_energy_added_wh,'kWh')
  at 1dp + " kWh". Duration reads MINUTES "{floor(min/60)}h {fmtInt(min%60)}m" (remainder NOT floored).
  SoC `{start}% → {end}%` only when END present (start may interpolate empty, web parity).
  "View all" → /charging. Empty → "No charging sessions recorded yet".
• fmtNumber grouping + half-away rounding + non-finite→0; km vs mi conversion — each unit-asserted
  (en-US golden values verified: "18.3 km", "11.4 mi", "52.9 kWh", "0h 25m", "1h 30m", "2h 2m",
  "1h 22m", "2h 6m", "1h 23m" for 82.6min, "88% → 74%", "44% → 80%", "% → 80%").
• TimeStamp → absolute "MMM d, h:mm a" (nil → "—") with relative ("2h ago") as the a11y alternate.

STATES (all render — no hidden surfaces)
  loading  → skeleton chrome (two redacted panels, reduce-motion safe)        [VehiclesRecentActivityLoading]
  empty    → both panels render their friendly per-panel empties (web parity) [.empty → panels]
  error    → QueryError-equivalent + Retry (only when no cached data)         [VehiclesRecentActivityErrorView]
  stale    → freshness chip + banner over cached panels + ONE guarded auto-refresh (re-armed on live)
  offline  → cached panels retained + offline chip/banner; no refetch
  content  → both populated panels

i18n   : every string via P1/S10 facade (table RecentActivityVehicles); no English literals in views.
a11y   : every interactive element labelled (two "View all" buttons + Retry); each row a combined
         VoiceOver element (arrow spoken as "to"); panels + surface carry container summaries;
         reduce-motion honored on FadeIn / skeleton / the animated row value; Dynamic Type throughout.
telemetry: `view.opened` emitted once on first appear with surface slug "RecentActivity" (P1/S11).

